# Formatting and lint on staged files only: fast enough to run every commit,
# and it keeps CI from failing on things a second of local work would have
# caught. The full check still runs in CI.

# Hooks run under `sh`, which never loads nvm, so the Node here is the system's
# and not the one `.nvmrc` asks for. Under Node 18 lint-staged dies with
# "TypeError: util.styleText is not a function" and the commit looks broken.
. scripts/select-node.sh || exit 1

npx lint-staged
